Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bakura, you still up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm with Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.47,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.43,0:01:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mokuba's fine. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So his soul's back in his body, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he's really all right? He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have believed a\Npegasus would keep his word?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.97,0:01:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how are you doing, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You feeling up to getting off this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not without Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.67,0:01:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's somewhere in this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he already knows you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi? Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Croquet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to his illness, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.31,0:01:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus will be unable to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a lame excuse to\Navoid paying off on the prizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All prizes are still to be awarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has already received his agreed-upon\Naward of Three Freed Souls, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition, there's this. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a card called The Ties of Friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only one of his kind,\Nhand-painted by Pegasus himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.13,0:02:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was instructed to deliver\Nit personally to Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You are now officially King of Games.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This contains a check for the prize money
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,won by Yuki and his\Nduel with Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all yours, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Three million dollars, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For your sister's operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been apart for so long, but\Nnow I can save her from going blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.77,0:02:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we'd like you all to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:03:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I just realized if Mokuba's\Nsoul has been returned, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it should mean that\NGrandpa's recovering too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get him\Nout of that hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.21,0:03:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba could be almost anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.49,0:03:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.51,0:03:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not get all mushy\Nand gooey, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.37,0:03:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Seto, I didn't know\Nwhat happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never stopped thinking\Nof you, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have risked anything\Nto save you, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi told me you risked a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we're together again, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say, little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for me to take you back home\Nwhere we both belong? You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving my\Nbrother Mokuba's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He means everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I do anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But because of our circumstances, our\Nlast duel was not really conclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.47,0:04:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,One day we will meet in the arena again to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,decide which of us is\Ntruly the better duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And one of us will walk away with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mokuba. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.57,0:04:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My copter's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.25,0:04:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.53,0:04:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved everyone, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We both did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been called many\Nthings through the ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, Yu-Gi-Oh, I've\Nbeen known as Yami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yami, I'm proud\Nto call you my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm proud to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All the boats have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So how are we supposed\Nto get off this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta hitch a ride. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for us, Kaiba! And us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki has the championship, Joey has\Nthe money, but I hold the real prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium I, and soon, I'll have\NYuki's Millennium puzzle as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.55,0:05:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not surprised to see\Nme up and about, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.23,0:05:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:06:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So you saved me and became champion\Nof the Duelist Kingdom, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it alone, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone helped. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody pitched in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But he couldn't have done it without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then you've obviously\Nimproved since I last saw you duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, not that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, maybe you\Nshould go home and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You did just get out of\Nthe hospital, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four,\None, two... Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mr. Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little stiff, that's all. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got something to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if you're who I think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is your name Solomon Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who might I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I might have just\Narrived here in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And I might have been\Nwaiting for you to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not nice to keep a lady waiting,\Nyou know. A lady? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'm not a lady, Buster?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a little squirt like you doing\Ntraveling all by yourself anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And if not, I've got Teddy to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.09,0:07:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.11,0:07:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She talks to the bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is it you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My card back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got my Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give it back to me! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you heard what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my Blue-Eyes back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a slight problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Blue-Eyes White Dragon\Nis an ultra-rare and powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,card that only belongs in\Nthe deck of a true champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Rebecca, am a true champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.27,0:07:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've traveled the world and beaten\Nmany top duelists while you were away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You've beaten top\Nduelists around the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I dare say I'm the\Nnumber one duelist in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a little young? I'm eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.93,0:08:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, inches tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't\Ntell lies, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.77,0:08:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it may not be a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember reading something,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,an article just before we left for the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.71,0:08:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,duelist kingdom about a\Nduel monster's prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She was causing a major sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not telling me this little pipsqueak's\Nreally the national champion, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get real, Yug. What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you questioning my\Ndueling credentials, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't give me any lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I got credentials, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Second in the duelist kingdom tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but on the other hand, you probably\Ndon't know how to spell credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,First place in the Duelist Kingdom went to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto, and second\Nplace went to Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But who cares who came in second?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only first place that really matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But Rebecca, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think your championship entitles\Nyou to my Blue Eyes White Dragon card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Blue Eyes White Dragon card should\Nbe mine because you stole it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.55,0:09:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait a minute. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd never steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there are only four Blue Eyes\NWhite Dragon cards in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's got three, and my card is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.75,0:09:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That Blue Eyes White Dragon is mine,\Nand if you won't give it back to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,then I demand the right to duel for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.81,0:09:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Grant's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just afraid to duel with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.21,0:09:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not afraid to duel you, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that that card, it's... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of your excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel me, old man, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Solomon Moto,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.87,0:09:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,if I win this duel, you give that\Nblue-eyes white dragon back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it take to penetrate\Nthat thick skull of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To the arena!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.29,0:09:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will eat you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a blue eyes, a real one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a statue, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I win again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Kaiba Land, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can you help us, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking a lot, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Kaivaland's dual rings are\Nbooked solid for the next three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But, of course, we do owe you big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.47,0:10:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so what are we all waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.27,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this duel on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice dueling arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A little small, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mr. Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But Grandpa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.99,0:10:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.47,0:10:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to duel or settle\Nin for an afternoon nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.11,0:10:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't duel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:10:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll face you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa was just released from\Nthe hospital this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in no condition\Nto be dueling, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then that's even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, the national\Nchampion versus Yugi Moto,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,winner of the duelist\Nkingdom in a clash of titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's still ordinary\Nhim against genius me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.77,0:11:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so he doesn't stand a chance\Nof winning, does he, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.19,0:11:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if she's just stuck\Non herself or totally nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys watch from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Be very careful, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She is strange. But smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yugi, sure you wanna go\Nthrough with this? I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but it'd be a lot easier just\Nto give me the blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up against a genius, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Teddy, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, yup, you're a genius, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get down to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.77,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth is this young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And why does she think I stole\Nher blue-eyes white dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.69,0:12:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn! Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,For my first brilliant move, Witch\Nof the Black Forest in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you're worth, witchy woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.83,0:12:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,An unusual opening gambit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Witch of the Black Forest isn't\Nreally that strong of a card at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, why would she play that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks very slowly, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.01,0:12:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you suppose he'll ever play a card?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Celtic Guardian in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian, attack the witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.23,0:12:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your Black Forest witch! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That mean old Yugi sent my\Nworthless witch to the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:12:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:12:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Witch of the Black\NForest is sent to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to pick another card for my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster with up to 1,500 defense points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And I get to shuffle my deck again! Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Teddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.23,0:13:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to play or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you distract me\Nwhen I'm faking. What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Decisions, decisions, decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid could drive\Nyou crazy really easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess I'm stuck with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Shining in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, he's so cute, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You can kiss Sangin goodbye. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Keldick Guardian attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.89,0:13:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That Celtic Guardian sent my poor\NSangin to the graveyard, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.47,0:14:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not being mean, I'm\Njust playing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasty old Yugi is yelling at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.23,0:14:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not yelling at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't lost just yet, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sangin goes to the graveyard,\NI can pull a new monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Geniuses are supposed to\Nbe eccentric, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That little twerp's no genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a nutcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's strategy is\Nstrangely familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid gloves are off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've met your match, Huggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, she's a lot more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.31,0:14:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I play a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.05,0:14:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tribute to the Doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me throw away one\Ncard from my own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:15:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange, I get to wipe out one of\Nmy opponent's monsters from the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hellcic Guardian went bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And to finish my turn, I play\None more card in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's where things start\Nto get interesting, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, the Blue-Eyes\NWhite Dragon will be mine again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I having hallucinations, or did she just\Nput on a totally different personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a lot smarter than\Nshe led us to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for her, Yugi! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That little kid stuff was just an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.43,0:15:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's a serious duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.41,0:15:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I attack with Summon Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Big mistake, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The card I played was\Nthe Millennium Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It has 3,000 defense points, and your\Nskull only has 2,500 attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So you lose 500 life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi's down 500 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that little sport can actually duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's trained her very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've seen that card before\Nwith its overwhelming defense power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.41,0:16:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called the Millennium Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting card, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.59,0:16:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your defense is now\Nimpenetrable, Professor Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Arthur, call me Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was at an archaeological dig in Egypt
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.53,0:16:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,so many years ago that\NI'd nearly forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but almost card for card, my friend Professor\NHawkins and I played this same duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so surprised that\NI won that last exchange?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I was a child prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel has been easy so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop him up, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I play a magic card, Ring of Magnetism.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.87,0:17:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, why would she play that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Combining it with the\NMillennium Shield actually
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,weakens the shield's\Noverwhelming defensive power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's confused, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to pass this turn. Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking a wait-and-see attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can't think of a move, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon Soldier, attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Be very careful, Yugi! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.15,0:17:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If she sacrifices a monster next,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,she can turn Cannon Soldier's assault\Ndirectly on Yugi's life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but she's never\Ngonna get the chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,because Yugi's Summoned Skull is\Ngonna blow Cannon Soldier away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, that soldier\Nwill do a lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.79,0:18:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull, attack Cannon Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Waste of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch what happens with his attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ring of Magnetism draws all your\Nattacks to my Millennium Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,While the Ring of Magnetism is in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my monsters are all safe, because all\Nyou can attack is my Millennium Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's got a defense power of 2,500. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a standoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoned Skull's attack\Npower is exactly equal
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.07,0:18:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to the defense power of\Nher Millennium Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.11,0:18:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to break through that\Nshield somehow in order to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.69,0:18:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you having a good time, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, cause this duel's\Ngonna get even better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh cool, it's the Shadow Ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This little baby will come\Nin handy a little later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:19:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, let's summon another Whippy\NWitch of the Black Forest in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You get used as a sacrifice\Nto my cannon soldier so he
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,can turn all his power\Ndirectly on Yugi's life point!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.99,0:19:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fulcher, you got her energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now blow Yugi away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that took you down a peg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Four hundred pegs to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.61,0:19:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I get to draw another card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.03,0:19:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She's real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have learned dueling from\Nsomebody as experienced as you, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.75,0:19:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was taught by someone more\Ntalented than a moto could ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandfather was the best duelist ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what I suspect true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.77,0:19:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, what's your last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.51,0:19:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my name is Rebecca Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And my grandfather is\NProfessor Arthur Hawkins,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the man whose blue-eyes white dragon you\Nstole and whose friendship you betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.59,0:20:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.89,0:20:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandfather would\Nnever betray a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But your grandfather is a thief, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.01,0:20:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He stole my grandfather's\Nblue-eyes, white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're gonna pay.
